WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.140
Connect story events with prior knowledge; identify the main idea, compare events and

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.280
infer a moral.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:11.853
Why is a story's setting useful? Answer: It tells where or when events happen.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:17.287
Read a short story aloud and explain which event is most important and why.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:21.146
Discuss why: Setting places events in a context.
